Subject: [PATCH 18/18] Add an on-screen keyboard skin widget,
 <OnScreenKeyboard>

[AI-generated text: this description was written autonomously by an AI
agent (Claude). Review it before relying on it or submitting it.]

A touch keyboard for a panel with no keyboard: digits, letters, - . and ',
backspace (repeating), clear, space and done. Its keys never take the
focus, so they type into whichever field has it, as a real keyboard
would; a skin shows it while [Library],focused_widget says the search box
has the focus. clear empties the field, and done sends Return, a second
time if the first only ran the search, so the search box moves on to the
results and the skin can put the keyboard away. No shift: library search
ignores case.

Tested on Windows: new tests type into a line edit and an editable
combo box through the keys, check that clear empties both and that no
key takes the focus; they pass with the existing widget and skin tests.

[End of AI-generated text.]

